# Blind probe for a title nobody has played through this host yet.
#
# Nothing here knows the game's menus. It taps the three buttons that get a
# PSP game past a logo, a movie and a title screen -- start, circle, cross --
# one at a time, every hundred polls, so whichever the game wants arrives
# within three hundred polls of it becoming receptive. A tap the game ignores
# costs one poll. Run with --decode so a movie plays instead of gating the run.
#
# Once someone has recorded a real route, replace this with it.

drain 300
minhold 4

  mark "start/circle/cross round-robin"
  @100 tap start
  @200 tap circle
  @300 tap cross
  @400 tap start
  @500 tap circle
  @600 tap cross
  @700 tap start
  @800 tap circle
  @900 tap cross
  @1000 tap start
  @1100 tap circle
  @1200 tap cross
  @1300 tap start
  @1400 tap circle
  @1500 tap cross
  @1600 tap start
  @1700 tap circle
  @1800 tap cross
  @1900 tap start
  @2000 tap circle
  @2100 tap cross
  @2200 tap start
  @2300 tap circle
  @2400 tap cross
  @2500 tap start
  @2600 tap circle
  @2700 tap cross
  @2800 tap start
  @2900 tap circle
  @3000 stop
